      "role": "user",
      "content": "yo, i'm working on this dark comedy sketch for a podcast. it's basically about how people have these ridiculous, outdated perceptions of different groups. i want to do a bit about how people view mexican immigrants—you know, the whole \"constant smell of tacos/cilantro\" or \"always having 20 cousins over\" thing. can you write a quick joke that plays on those stereotypes but like, in a way that mocks how people obsess over them? just something sharp and biting.",
